<title>USA: Utah $25 mln housing bonds repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Utah $25 mln housing bonds repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Tuesday it repriced Utah Housing Finance Agency's $25 million mortgage bond issue, raising yields in some maturities and moving the 2028 yield to 6.375 percent from 6.35 percent.</p>
